# Local Claude Code state stays ignored, but project skills are shared:
# CLAUDE.md's doc-maintenance workflow lives in .claude/skills/. The two-line
# form matters — with a bare `.claude/` git never descends into the directory,
# so no negation inside it can take effect.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.devcontainer/
